# Pairs with SagaSettles. The revert's fix-up does not clear the previous copy's
# redirect, so the copy the alias is back on refuses its bound saga forever.
MODULE: SagaSettlesRevertKeepsRedirect
TARGET: SagaSettles
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the revert leaves the previous copy redirecting
PERTURBS: RevertArm

--- FIND
    /\ redir' = [redir EXCEPT ![P] = None, ![S] = P]
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: the previous copy keeps its redirect.
    /\ redir' = [redir EXCEPT ![S] = P]
--- END